    "name": "Make it! Choco Banana",
    "steam_appid": 3832330,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make choco bananas on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dip each banana in chocolate and add a topping, making choco bananas to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRules\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choco bananas to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dip bananas in chocolate, decorate them with tasty toppings, and serve them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make as many as you can before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Prepare a banana and skewer it on a stick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Dip the banana in chocolate! Choose from choco, matcha, strawberry and mint flavors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. When the chocolate has set, add a topping! Choose from sprinkles, sugar balls, and choco sauce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. When the chocolate has hardened, serve the choco banana!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip up as many choco bananas as possible and aim for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your choco banana-making skills!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's make choco bananas on the Steam!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dip each banana in chocolate and add a topping, making choco bananas to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach for the ultimate high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aRules\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choco bananas to order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dip bananas in chocolate, decorate them with tasty toppings, and serve them up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make as many as you can before time runs out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300aHow to Play\u300b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Prepare a banana and skewer it on a stick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Dip the banana in chocolate! Choose from choco, matcha, strawberry and mint flavors!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. When the chocolate has set, add a topping! Choose from sprinkles, sugar balls, and choco sauce!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. When the chocolate has hardened, serve the choco banana!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Score Attack]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whip up as many choco bananas as possible and aim for the top spot on the leaderboards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Battle]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others and test your choco banana-making skills!</p>",
